video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel a cursed world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a map filled with unpredictable encounters and dangerous enemies waiting to challenge you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921690/extras/5302494dc35bb5216e4b1758437fbdb2.poster.avif?t=1771432298\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921690/extras/5302494dc35bb5216e4b1758437fbdb2.webm?t=1771432298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921690/extras/5302494dc35bb5216e4b1758437fbdb2.mp4?t=1771432298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spend Your Soul, Seize Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exhaust your cards (pieces of your soul) to unlock powerful actions: Recharge weapons, interact with wandering people, open glowing chests and empower your hero with buffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921690/extras/5e1ce2b8769f55a619ba3d85bd5dadaf.poster.avif?t=1771432298\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921690/extras/5e1ce2b8769f55a619ba3d85bd5dadaf.webm?t=1771432298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921690/extras/5e1ce2b8769f55a619ba3d85bd5dadaf.mp4?t=1771432298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who was the stranger? Why did they curse you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["CarloC"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"